WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Nusumareta kako wo

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
Sagashitsuzukete

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Ore wa samayou

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
Mishiranu machi wo

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Honou no nioi shimitsuite

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Museru

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Sayonara wa itta hazu da

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Wakareta hazu sa

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
Jigoku wo mireba

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Kokoro ga kawaku

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Tatakai wa akita no sa

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
Sadame to areba

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Kokoro wo kimeru

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Sottoshite oite kure

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Ashita ni

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Aa tsunagaru kyou gurai

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:38.380
For a hundred years the Astragius galaxy
had been split by war.

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:42.630
I was ordered into an operation
whose details were kept from me.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:48.880
There, my destiny was changed
the moment I saw her.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:53.540
She was apparently the military's greatest secret.

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:58.920
Since deserting the army, the war ended...

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:00.580
and I found myself in the city of Uoodo.

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:04.710
Now I have the city's police force trying to kill me.

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:07.210
But why?

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:10.710
I've done nothing to have earned
these constant attacks.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:16.250
PROTOTYPE

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:22.290
Chirico! Run for it! Run!

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.540
Move it! Move it!

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:37.790
Don't let him get away! After him!

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:42.250
I'd say we've underestimated Chirico.

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:55.790
They went in here!

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:00.460
This way!

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:04.080
You know where we're running, right?

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:05.880
If you don't want to die, then shut up and follow me!

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.330
Stop! Stop or I'll shoot!

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:14.710
If we stop, you will shoot!

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:17.000
After them!

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:17.630
Yes, Sir!
After them!

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:19.250
Move it!

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:46.380
This way!

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:56.290
You must be starving. Take it easy and eat.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.580
Generous with other people's food, aren't you?

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:00.080
You got it.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:03.290
I'm coming back to life again.

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:05.380
Thought we'd make ourselves at home.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.250
By all means, please.

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.830
Now then, Chirico. Can we talk?

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:22.670
Huh? Playing dumb? Knock it off already.
Why do the cops have it in for you?

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.170
Why do you say that?

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:30.500
Why? They don't usually butt
into Real Battles like that.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.830
You've got the cops after you
for some other reason.

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:35.830
I was thinking the same thing.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:41.330
That Real Battle match looked like a trap
for both you and me.

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:45.420
But the cops were after you specifically. Why?

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:52.630
I'm tired. Will you let me rest?

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:57.920
It's the war's fault. Nobody's honest anymore.

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.420
Tell me about it.

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.210
I meant you, too.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:05.130
Me? I'm the very picture of honesty!
And philanthropic, to boot!

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:06.830
Sure you are.

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.540
Okay, so answer me this:

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:12.670
Why'd you risk getting the cops on your ass
just to save Chirico?

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:17.830
Why? Well... I told you. I want him to be my friend.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.460
There are other guys you can be friends with.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:25.040
Not like him! Nobody can fight as well as that guy!

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.040
Nobody else'll do but him.

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:30.130
He just sorta suits you, huh?

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.080
Exactly.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:33.250
And that's the only reason why?

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:36.580
Just that and only that.You guys are paranoid!

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.750
What are you up to?

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:46.080
Everything began with that mission...

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.250
What was she?

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.500
Lieutenant Conin...

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:59.130
Captain Oriya...

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.290
Whatever the reason,
my enemies are trying to get rid of me.

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:05.040
But if I could somehow
get in contact with the police chief...

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:09.380
I don't think Chirico's gotten out of Uoodo.

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:11.790
We'll get a tip on him, you can count on it.

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:13.960
Don't underestimate him.

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:16.630
We know he has friends helping him now.

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:21.130
I know. The whole city's on alert for him.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:24.040
Perhaps we should contact Headquarters.

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:29.290
Rain again...

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:42.630
Wha...? He's gone! Chirico's gone!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:43.630
What?

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:04.170
If this works, I'll have him.

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:14.380
Oh well, there go all our plans.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:17.170
God dammit! The one that got away.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.880
He's not some prize catch for you two!

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:24.000
Says you! I was gonna go after
the jijirium storage site!

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:24.670
You what?

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:31.670
So that was your game. That's a hell of a plan.

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:34.830
Why do I have to be such a blabbermouth?

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:37.710
You were gonna get him to join you
and use him in the heist.

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:38.540
Of course!

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:41.670
That's the cops' main armory.
It's crawling with guards.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:43.380
With him helping me, I coulda...

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:44.830
Well, it's all screwed now.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.420
You're such a kid.

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:52.750
I bet you didn't know there's an abandoned
subway line that runs straight to the armory.

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:54.460
No kidding?

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:58.290
No kidding. If we use that we could pull it off.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:01.330
Come on, Vanilla. Wanna bring me in on this?

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.580
You, Pops?

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:06.000
Sure. No reason to give up just 'cuz Chirico's gone.

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:07.330
Well?

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:09.040
Bring me in, too!

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:10.210
You, too?

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.000
In place of Chirico.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:15.040
If you say no, I'll come anyway.

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:16.040
I mean it!

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:18.750
She sure looks serious.

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:22.460
God, you're a greedy couple of guys!

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:25.420
But we don't even know
if we can use that subway line.

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:27.750
Let's check it out before
we start sweating the details.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:28.920
Gotcha.

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:31.750
You're a real mercenary, aren't you, Pops?

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:34.000
You want that jijirium more than you want Chirico.

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:58.000
Well, what do you know?

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.330
Who'd have thought there was
an old subway down here?

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:03.460
Way to go, Old Man! Still sharp in your old age!

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:05.170
Okay, let's get ready.

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:14.960
Even if we replace the battery, will this thing run?

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:16.460
We'll manage.

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:17.540
Is this okay?

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:19.170
Yeah...

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:20.790
Here.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.380
Okay, let's go! All aboard!

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:18.710
Yeah? What do you want?

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:20.250
Open it.

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:22.710
You...!

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:06.460
Who are you?

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:15.170
Y-you...!

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:19.000
Now, are you going to tell me
why you're all after me?

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:22.500
I'll bet it has something to do
with that mission I was assigned to.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:27.920
The outfit I was in attacked a military asteroid base.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:29.580
But it was one of our own.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:33.580
And it involved the theft of
some sort of life form and gold ingots.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:37.380
What was the mission all about?
Why are you after me?

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:39.830
I'm pretty sure you were in on that mission as well.

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:42.580
Answer me!

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:49.960
A lot of people died on that mission.

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:52.380
One more death would hardly be worth counting!

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:56.000
Wait! I'll take you to where
you'll understand everything!

00:11:57.210 --> 00:11:58.670
Where I'll understand everything?

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:01.630
It's outside of town. I'll take you there.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.920
Son of a... That's just great.

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.460
Okay, gimme a hand moving this stuff.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:46.540
Okay, let's go.

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:11.210
So, this is the old military armory.

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:14.170
These cops really know how to pick a place.

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:15.880
Quit your yapping.

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:16.790
Yessir.

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:17.830
Gimme a gun.

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:18.670
Right.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:35.580
There... You're saying that "Prototype" is there?

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.420
Yeah, at the old armory.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:40.250
It's a jijirium storage site, now.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.040
Looks like they noticed us. Let's go!

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:55.080
Hold it!

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:57.330
Alert, all personnel!

00:13:57.330 --> 00:14:00.460
Security teams one and two to the helipad!

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:01.830
Intruder alert!

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:03.880
Looks like it's not about us.

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:30.790
Lemme go, you creep!

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:32.790
Thanks.

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:33.500
No problemo.

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:50.960
Shoot!

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:07.000
We'll sneak in with all this commotion. Come on!

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:11.670
Where'd he go?

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:12.130
Dunno!

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:13.380
Find him!

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:14.080
Yes, sir!

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:25.420
Where'd he go?

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:26.790
Can't see him! Try over there!

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:30.170
What?

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:31.830
Uh, well...

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:43.830
Huh? Chirico!

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:45.630
What?

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:54.960
Chirico, it's me! Vanilla!

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:56.920
Turn right and run straight through!

00:15:57.290 --> 00:15:58.540
They're weakest on that side!

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:02.210
After him! Don't let him go!

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:15.630
After him! He can't escape!

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:24.540
Down there!

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.420
Where'd he go? This way?

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:31.830
Chirico, it's me!

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:32.880
This way.

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:45.250
Wasn't expecting this.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:57.630
What's with you?  Haven't you ever seen a naked
body before?

00:17:57.630 --> 00:17:59.080
Jijirium!

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:00.250
What?

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:02.040
Jijirium?

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:23.000
What's with him? He's that kind of guy?
What a letdown!

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:26.500
He may be weird, but he's still a guy.

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:28.290
And she's a dish!

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:32.040
You can't depend on guys! Not on your life!

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:44.040
It has to be her.

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:47.380
Mind if I get a peek, too?

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:49.920
No, you idiot! That's going too far!

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:15.170
Is this the Prototype?

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:20.420
She is the girl I saw!

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:30.960
Don't you remember me?

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:40.380
I know we've met.

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:42.290
Wait!

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.000
It is her! I'm sure of it!

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:57.830
Hey, what's wrong, Chirico? Do you know her?

00:19:58.080 --> 00:19:59.670
There she is. Down there.

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:15.960
She's gone! Where'd she go?

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:18.380
The heliport.

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:21.710
Oh well, better forget the jijirium and just take him!

00:20:21.710 --> 00:20:24.380
There! It's them! Down there!

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:27.080
Why, you...!

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:30.960
I'll cover you. Go!

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:31.540
Thanks!

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:46.460
Take that!

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:47.830
Come on, get in!

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:56.170
Coconna, get on the rear guns!

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:57.170
Gotcha!

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.540
Don't let them go! Kill them all!

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:22.670
Chirico, grab on!

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:36.250
Close the hatch! Don't let them escape!

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:42.710
Vanilla, what's the problem? Go faster!

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:44.250
We're overloaded!

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:45.630
Then do something!

00:21:45.750 --> 00:21:47.580
Maybe if I pop off all the missiles...

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:06.290
Sink or swim time!

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:42.920
It was her.

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:46.290
Was that really the Prototype?

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:48.250
But what is she?

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.750
NEXT EPISODE

00:22:56.290 --> 00:23:00.670
In the polluted sea that is Uoodo,
an ice floe known as the Prototype is hidden.

00:23:00.880 --> 00:23:04.330
Its secret roots are buried deeply
and heavily beneath the water's surface.

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:08.380
A man's destiny may be decided
by a roll of God's dice,

00:23:08.460 --> 00:23:11.880
but heaven and earth is the board
upon which the pieces move.

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:17.210
Whatever evil waits to appear,
enemies will cross paths in the quest for a secret.

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:19.750
Next time, "Raid"

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:23.920
Will Chirico risk his life yet again?

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:23.920
Next Time

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:23.920
Raid

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Samishii toki mo

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Kanashii toki mo

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
Itsumo anata ga me ni ukabu

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Hitori no toki mo

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Aitai toki mo

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
Itsumo anata wa mune no naka

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
Tooku hanarete itemo

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
Tatoe wakarete itemo

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
Kono yo no hikari to tomo ni mabushiku

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Ano hi no anata ga...
